        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Create Vector Database Ingestion Job",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://flow.seekr.com/v1/flow/vectordb/:database_id/ingestion",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "database_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "Authorization",
              "value": "{{Authorization}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Create a new vector database ingestion job.\n\n**`method` — document extraction strategy:**\n- `accuracy-optimized` *(default)* — runs the full Seekr pipeline (up to 12 methods: bookmark-aware hybrid extraction, Seekr-SaaS OCR, LLM post-processing, PyMuPDF, and more) with no restrictions, always selecting the highest-quality result\n- `speed-optimized` — same pipeline, but skips methods that exceed per-method word-count thresholds; significantly faster on large documents\n\n**`chunking_method` — text "
        },
