        {
          "info": {
            "name": "List Vector Database Chunks",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://flow.seekr.com/v1/flow/vectordb/:database_id/chunks",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "database_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "Authorization",
              "value": "{{Authorization}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Search/list chunks in a vector database with optional filtering.\n\nSupports filtering by `file_id`, `chunk_ids`, and `metadata` fields.\nMetadata filters support operator syntax: `$gt`, `$gte`, `$lt`, `$lte`, `$in`.\nUnknown operators return 400.\n\nRequest body example:\n```json\n{\n  \"file_id\": \"file-abc123\",\n  \"metadata\": {\"year\": {\"$gte\": 2023}, \"doc_type\": \"SOP\"},\n  \"limit\": 20,\n  \"offset\": 0\n}\n```"
        },
